				<wikidot:authorName>mickeyten</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4444390</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is outstanding. After all the SCPs I've read boiling down to &quot;giant deity/thing is hurtling to Earth and we're fucked&quot;, with and without secret cults doing their best to hasten the apocalypse, I can't put a finger on why I like this one so much. I think part of it may be that this is a fraction of the length those articles tend to be, pulling off the intended suspense and leaving me wanting a lot more. Well done.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
